Apple is promoting the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/04/apple-announces-low-cost-macbook-neo-with-a18-pro-chip/">MacBook Neo</a> with a series of <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@apple">intentionally strange TikTok videos</a> that are successfully capturing Gen Z's attention.<br/>
<br/>
